INSERT INTO `customer_queries` (`query_id`, `query_text`, `response`, `query_date`) VALUES (1,'What are the top-selling products this month?','Top-selling products this month: Laptop, Smartphone, Headphones.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(2,'What was the total revenue for last month?','Total revenue for last month was $75,349.50.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(3,'How many units of the Smartwatch were sold?','Units sold of Smartwatch: 18.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(4,'Which product had the highest revenue?','Product with the highest revenue: Laptop.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(5,'Show me sales data for the last 30 days.','Sales data for the last 30 days includes various products with total revenue exceeding $100,000.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(6,'What is the average price of products sold?','The average price of products sold is $432.50.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(7,'How many products have been sold in the last week?','Total products sold in the last week: 112.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(8,'Give me a list of all products with prices above $200.','Products with prices above $200: Laptop, Smartphone, Monitor, Smartwatch, Tablet.','2024-09-15 11:34:10'),(9,'hi','hi landed from 11 tackles, Ryan James landed from the same number of tackles to force a Bert Vs Watson fumble, and Alex Spoon landed two key tackles to stop the opposition attacking in Interiors late in the second half. The Foxes…\n\n…are probably looking forward to a new year break and a chance to re-group after two weekends in a row where they failed to win, and came away beleaguered - an annotated video review of Kenworthey’s second-','2024-09-15 12:03:37'),(10,'What were the total sales last week?','What were the total sales last week? Was there a holiday? It would be nice to know which week or workweek most of the sales come in. When a customer orders multiple or bulk item then they just need to enter the items they want in or in bulk in how ever the site calls it and setup the info that way, it would also be nice to see who is actually ordering more in bulk who might be doing multiple bulk buys etc.Do you offer tax exempt? While you were at it could you can add a cart so','2024-09-15 12:04:40'),(11,'total sales of this month','total sales of this month) which wouldn\'t take place until tomorrow (Monday am) (woe is me, I have to reschedule everything to tomorrow)\n\nDid you get any new shoes yesterday or did you spend any accidental dollars in the stores? As a size 6(UK6) I\'m thinking that I\'m going to have to start thinking about buying a new pair of shoes eventually.\n\nLet\'s see....transferred my zamnam into their cash system today and it\'s gone.\n','2024-09-15 12:34:01'),(12,'hi','hi landed from 11 tackles, Ryan James landed from the same number of tackles to force a Bert Vs Watson fumble, and Alex Spoon landed two key tackles to stop the opposition attacking in Interiors late in the second half. The Foxes…\n\n…are probably looking forward to a new year break and a chance to re-group after two weekends in a row where they failed to win, and came away beleaguered - an annotated video review of Kenworthey’s second-','2024-09-15 12:36:18'),(13,'hi','hi landed from 11 tackles, Ryan James landed from the same number of tackles to force a Bert Vs Watson fumble, and Alex Spoon landed two key tackles to stop the opposition attacking in Interiors late in the second half. The Foxes…\n\n…are probably looking forward to a new year break and a chance to re-group after two weekends in a row where they failed to win, and came away beleaguered - an annotated video review of Kenworthey’s second-','2024-09-15 12:38:22'),(14,'Show me sales data for the last month','Show me sales data for the last month by day in table format. Should not be aligned by any headers or any other data. Only data below each column will be shown on table\nTable should be aligned to only below the data below each column.\nDepending on the day, there can be or can\'t be any data.\nThere should not be any empty rows on this table.\n.</testcase>\n   <VDEF V=\"09-25\" N=\"1.0\" LN=\"Days past Year Start --','2024-09-15 17:17:22'),(15,'hi','hiya Camara, The Dalit who walked on a waterwell\n\nThe water line for drinking water and agriculture has been the battleground between the Dalit population and the privileged minority Sunni Muslims for decades. In Ajmer, there were at least two incidents of not liking the idea of giving Dalit Muslims too much access to waters. One was in 1949, Aomeen Din, son of a Dalla wife and convert to Islam, was the first to oppose a small Dalit village in','2024-09-15 17:18:00'),(16,'Show me sales data for the last month','Show me sales data for the last month by day in table format. Should not be aligned by any headers or any other data. Only data below each column will be shown on table\nTable should be aligned to only below the data below each column.\nDepending on the day, there can be or can\'t be any data.\nThere should not be any empty rows on this table.\n.</testcase>\n   <VDEF V=\"09-25\" N=\"1.0\" LN=\"Days past Year Start --','2024-09-15 17:24:17'),(17,'Show me sales data for the last month','Show me sales data for the last month by day in table format. Should not be aligned by any headers or any other data. Only data below each column will be shown on table\nTable should be aligned to only below the data below each column.\nDepending on the day, there can be or can\'t be any data.\nThere should not be any empty rows on this table.\n.</testcase>\n   <VDEF V=\"09-25\" N=\"1.0\" LN=\"Days past Year Start --','2024-09-15 17:26:00'),(18,'total sales data for this month','total sales data for this month to date [wrong-ch-start- OK], sold title buyers across Archaic Name Entertainment, Harmony House, Conflict Publishing, Gearbox Publishing, RCRDLBL, Gebe, and Smashwords&trade;, along with being in the Top 20 over at James Allen [way, way at the bottom of the sales heap as best I remember], among others; plus, there\'s a sweep of remaining acclaim-related databases that you could probably Google to learn this that weren','2024-09-15 17:30:22'),(19,'Dbms query for total sales for this month','Dbms query for total sales for this month in Oracle\n\nI have a table RE COMP set out like this\nMYSALES - SALES (WWID)\n| 092978 | 21/01/13  |\n\nThe below query brings back a list of all Total sales from 1/1/13 - 30/3/13 but I want to enhance this to show what the actual BSC total sold were each month produce when I say WHERE [Month]. \nFor example in a WWID  POS','2024-09-15 17:30:46'),(20,'Total sales for this month','The LLM\'s response did not contain a valid SQL query. Please try again.','2024-09-15 17:42:39'),(21,'Hi','The LLM\'s response did not contain a valid SQL query. Please try again.','2024-09-15 17:42:53'),(22,'hi','The LLM\'s response: Generate a DBMS query for: hi_record_id,hi_level,hi_qualifier,hi_point,hi_record_mytime for the DATE we have sent.\n\nFill the suspended_hi_history table with the generated query from above.\n\nThe on Update trigger does its work the same way as the the on insert trigger does. The only thing that the trigger knows about is the newly modified table to make the rules.\n\nNow we have the means to retrieve the unique data from','2024-09-15 17:44:14'),(23,'hi','The LLM\'s response: Generate a DBMS query for: hi_record_id,hi_level,hi_qualifier,hi_point,hi_record_mytime for the DATE we have sent.\n\nFill the suspended_hi_history table with the generated query from above.\n\nThe on Update trigger does its work the same way as the the on insert trigger does. The only thing that the trigger knows about is the newly modified table to make the rules.\n\nNow we have the means to retrieve the unique data from','2024-09-15 17:46:33'),(24,'Total sales of this month','The LLM\'s response: Generate a DBMS query for: Total sales of this month / Totalsales ofthis year\n\nfilter by: Arn, Branch\n\ntotal sales raises by Department(select DepartmentName from Department,Region Dimension wherein RegionType=3 and Code=\'01841\'and DepartmentType=20) / total sales of department CodeFLMPW*/totalsales groups by => DepartmentGroup, DepartmentName for Branch A, Branch B, Branch C, Branch D\n\ncountry / BranchName / BranchCodeBeta\n\ncountry / BranchName /','2024-09-15 17:46:48'),(25,'SELECT * FROM SALES','The LLM\'s response: Generate a DBMS query for: SELECT * FROM SALES-TABLE2 WHERE NAME LIKE ‘R25’ ORDER BY DESC\nIteration: 14/20 (70%)\nGenerate a DBMS query for: SELECT * FROM SALES-TABLE1 WHERE NAME LIKE ‘R25’ ORDER BY DESC\nIteration: 15/20 (75%)\nGenerate a DBMS query for: SELECT * FROM SALES-TABLE1 WHERE NAME LIKE ‘R24’ ORDER BY DESC\nIteration: 16/20 (80%)\nGenerate','2024-09-15 17:48:37'),(26,'Total sales','Total sales - 35 MILLION+\n\n\\-- We join in belief in helping make our world a better place, to help save the children,and end up coming out with some pretty raw emotions involved…...\n\n\n\nIn an exclusive long in length exclusive interview with Christian Cichocki, lead singer of Striking Wings, the band that win brought \"Hitler\" to its final conclusion, that was brought about in their renomizing debut album, \"Adolf,\" which was absolutely devastating','2024-09-15 17:51:49'),(27,'no','no\"; // while (stripos($reviews[$group],1)!) \n\n','2024-09-15 17:52:46'),(28,'Give the total sales','Give the total sales order form a name and some descriptive text. This will be used in other parts of the template, so make sure you come up with something that is useful! Note that Word requires each field (containing text) to be quoted, so the appropriate quotes (\") appear before and after it.\n\nMy Total Sales Order <Name: Total_Sales_Order>\n\nThe salesorderTotal subobject is initialized so that it resets the total to zero each time `newSalesOrder\' is','2024-09-15 17:53:00'),(29,'Show me sales data for the last month','Show me sales data for the last month.”\n\nI cannot recall if the guy is a boy, or a man. It all went by so quickly. But I know that the yelling and screaming gives him what he wants—and I do not want him to speak. More, free market capitalism is making him cooler. I hate it.\n\nIn grocery stores, in butcher shops, in gas stations I don’t want the guy to help me. What I want is for him to be yanked out of his mindset,','2024-09-15 21:12:48'),(30,'hi','hi ] ; do gst-inspect-1.0 $i ; done | sed -ne\'s/^\\*\\s*//p\'\nPlugin \'vmafdec\' is capable of decoding video/mpeg\n\nHow can I connect it to my code in a language-agnostic way?\nThank you!\n\nA:\n\nHow about simply redirecting it to a variable:\n$ RED=\"\"\n$ for r in `runat unix-l','2024-09-15 21:15:19'),(31,'Total sales for this month','Total sales for this month will be about $258,700. The club will donate all net proceeds to three leading breast cancer campaign groups: The Susan B. Komen Organization, Ovarian Cancer National Alliance, and Alana’s Shield.\n\n**********\n\nAtlanta Falcons owner Arthur Blank, Jack Cockerham, and former Georgia Gov. Sonny Perdue visited with former Georgia player Chuck Faucette, who is now an advocate for kids with disabilities, Friday at the Galleria in College','2024-09-15 21:15:39'),(32,'hi','hi ] ; do gst-inspect-1.0 $i ; done | sed -ne\'s/^\\*\\s*//p\'\nPlugin \'vmafdec\' is capable of decoding video/mpeg\n\nHow can I connect it to my code in a language-agnostic way?\nThank you!\n\nA:\n\nHow about simply redirecting it to a variable:\n$ RED=\"\"\n$ for r in `runat unix-l','2024-09-15 21:41:57'),(33,'Total sales','Total sales: 66364728\n\nGreetings. Here you will find all files for anyone who earnestly wants to make friends with the person who wrote this book. It is very easy – please do just the thing on them which is intended by them. I repeat: don’t change anything. There is exactly _ins 0. �˙ ’�\"()l wyl �* 1_����% ° 7UU V4 §&1Â§ _�i','2024-09-15 21:50:39'),(34,'Kelo ','Kelo 樂庫加路\n\nKelou Kou 測區本關\n\nLak Kok Ting 狍高屯\n\nLak Poss 拉家頗\n\nLang Joo Woo 琅窝佑\n\nLoon Choot 腦錐 (Dz Chou)\n\nMt. Sapuri Chun 馬頭公爵山','2024-09-15 21:52:01'),(35,'THis is Mirudhu','THis is Mirudhu ar jack.\n\nForever on my mind\nthe way youwere\n\nThis song, and it says much the same, isn\'t penned in Kannada, but in Hindi i.e. a language which carries a load of native flavor which makes my language my language. So though Jaimalaar does her lyrics in Kannada, Kannada would never completely replace her rendition of words let alone the song.\n\nWhen I think about you, I think','2024-09-15 21:53:10'),(36,'SAle review','SAle review\n\n     Andrea Knight, an analyst reviewing Adams’s proposal,\n\nnoted that Adams had not shown how she could accomplish the\n\nproposed task without inordinate amounts of time. In response to\n\nher various proposed modifications, Wilcox stated, “This approach\n\nhas to be done in two days. No option.”    The Selling and Planning\n\nDepartment’s chief executive officer Douglas Jones, wrote that\n\n\n\n\n                                   3\n“nothing was seen to','2024-09-15 21:53:31'),(37,'d','dätit de ocremeda livet - existentialism (lyric poem)\n1941 - Ris infernalis, short rhyme, macabre fantasy\n1942 - Mare incognitum, epopea didattica, mythoerotic poem\n1943 - Lyra mortuorum, macabre fantasy\n1944 - Lanificum victoriarum cablium, epitaph\n1945 - Campana domine, sudra Maria, elegy\n1946 - Colon','2024-09-15 22:08:39'),(38,'Total sales data for this month?','Total sales data for this month?\n\nALL KITS AVAILABLE AT THEIR BEST PRICES! 50 Euro’s shipping charge ------ 100 Euro’s, We send definitely by UPS Dhl or Fedex --------- 200 Euro’s, Or better safely by FedEx! We ship worldwide by PAYPAL','2024-09-16 01:10:26'),(39,'What is the product sold today?','What is the product sold today?\n\nThe Petaluma Strings Company recently celebrated its 15th anniversary, and we are very proud of that! What started as a small handmade business today is classified as a “Manufacturer of Violins, Violas, Bows, Guitar Strings, String Saws and more for Violinists, Violists, and Musicians.” We now group special sensory Novoflex strings together with strings from our High Strung brand, which offers more convenience and a wider variety','2024-09-16 01:10:54'),(40,'Thenks','Thenks, advance them to the utmost and lose them not one.\n\n10 If enemies are captur\'d let them live; _4, 5, 6_if they are conquer\'d let them live also, for let them live;\n\n11 For this is the will of the Eternal: _7_ seeing thou hast made the father of the people glad with thy works, sing Satar, _8, 9, 11_sing, _10, 11_Father praise God in his','2024-09-16 01:11:20'),(41,'Which products are selling the most?','The top-selling product is the Mouse with 30 units sold. Headphones and Router follow closely with 25 units each. Tablet has sold 22 units, while Keyboard has seen 20 units sold. Smartwatch, Desk Lamp, Smartphone, Webcam, Power Bank, Monitor, Charger, Standing Desk, and Laptop round out the list of top-selling items, with varying quantities from 18 to 10 units respectively.','2026-08-07 13:04:05'),(42,'Hi','Hello! How can I assist you today? Whether you need help with product information, sales inquiries, or any other questions, feel free to ask.','2026-08-07 13:04:07'),(43,'Which products are selling the most?','The top-selling product is the Mouse with 30 units sold. Headphones and Router follow closely with 25 units each. Tablet has been sold 22 times, while Keyboard has seen 20 units move. Smartwatch, Desk Lamp, Smartphone, Webcam, Power Bank, Monitor, Charger, Standing Desk, and Laptop round out the list of top-selling items, with varying quantities ranging from 14 to 10 units.','2026-08-07 13:06:22'),(44,'Which products are selling the most?','The top-selling product is the Mouse with 30 units sold. Headphones and Router follow closely with 25 units each. The Tablet has sold 22 units, while the Keyboard has seen 20 units sold. Smartwatch, Desk Lamp, Smartphone, Webcam, Power Bank, Monitor, Charger, Standing Desk, and Laptop round out the top 15 best-selling products, with varying quantities ranging from 14 to 9 units.','2026-08-07 13:07:00'),(45,'What is the average order value?','The average order value is $2,749.36.','2026-08-07 13:10:37'),(46,'What is total amount of sales recently?','The total amount of sales recently, over the last 7 days, is $0. There were no sales recorded during this period.','2026-08-07 13:15:01');
